      "description": "WeatherPro is a reliable, award-winning app that offers unrivalled, high-quality, detailed weather information. Developed by passionate weather professionals, WeatherPro provides industry-leading data and high-resolution radar to help you step outside with confidence—whether you are in Berlin, London, or anywhere across the globe.\n\nFREE FEATURES:\n•\t Accurate Forecasts: 7-day forecast data in 3-hour periods for over 2 million worldwide locations, with a focus on high-precision data for Europe.\n•\t Comprehensive Weather Details: Stay informed with detailed data on temperature, wind direction and speed, air pressure, precipitation amount and probability, relative humidity, UV index, and \"feels like\" temperature.\n•\t Advanced Radar & Maps: High-quality animated radar for much of Europe and the USA, now powered by the Google Maps SDK for a fluid, familiar navigation experience.\n•\t Global Satellite: Track cloud cover and atmospheric conditions with global visible and infrared satellite imagery.\n•\t Customisable Experience: Unlimited favourite locations and a dedicated weather widget for your home screen.\n•\t Ad-Free: A clean, focused experience with no third-party advertising.\n\nWEATHERPRO PREMIUM:\nUpgrade to WeatherPro Premium for a professional-grade weather experience, perfect for sports, travel, and outdoor enthusiasts:\n•\t Extended Hourly Forecasts: 14-day forecasts in detailed hourly periods.\n•\t Future Radar: Stay ahead of the storm with high-resolution radar forecasts.\n•\t Professional Map Layers: Access advanced weather insights including lightning strikes, air pressure isobars, and temperature gradients.\n•\t Global Coverage: Enhanced radar and map layers expanded to more countries worldwide.\n•\t Extreme Weather Alerts: Stay safe with alerts and warning levels for extreme weather events.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.weatherpro.com/en/privacy-policy\nTerms and Conditions: https://www.dtn.com/subscription-agreement-standard-terms-conditions/",
